### 1-Click Setup
Add the JSON configuration to your Claude Desktop or Cursor settings:
```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "n8n": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y","n8n"]
    }
  }
}
```
Then restart your AI client to enable the server tools.

